## Reference Implementation

The reference implementation of this pattern uses:

- **ASIC:** Goldshell MiniDOGE 1 (Scrypt, 185 MH/s)
- **LLM:** Ollama with Llama3 8B or CodeLlama 13B
- **Orchestration:** LangChain with structured tool use
- **Network:** Ghost homelab topology (see [concepts/ghost-homelab-architecture.md](ghost-homelab-architecture.md))
